lemo-opuscar, copyright 2026 LemoLab, MIT; upstream https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar (3961ddb3d24d8876e0e2754f7790d66908acee51). Standard includes ten style guides and common authoring helpers. Full MIT text: server/general/kit/LICENSE.lemo-opuscar. Attribution: server/general/kit/ATTRIBUTION.md.
