# 来源与授权

本目录的技能文档来自 HyperFrames（https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes），授权为 Apache License 2.0。原样随 OpenTake 分发，供出片智能体查阅，未作修改。HyperFrames 是 HeyGen 的项目，OpenTake 与其没有隶属关系。

OpenScreen, MIT, copyright OpenScreen contributors including Etienne Lescot and Siddharth Vaddem, https://github.com/getopenscreen/openscreen. The embedded editor and its native host source are retained; Standard supplies screen-only storage and API adapters. Original LICENSE and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md are preserved in vendor/openscreen. The upstream notices describe upstream installers; this source export includes none of their native executables, models, DLLs or installers.

FFmpeg: LGPLv3 shared build (with OpenSSL 3); no FFmpeg executable is distributed in this source export. Users provide their compatible LGPL build. FFmpeg licensing: https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html; source: https://ffmpeg.org/download.html. Installation and corresponding modified-build source distribution are task 11 responsibilities. Do not redistribute a modified binary without its exact corresponding source, patches, configure command and LGPL dependency sources.

Headless browser: Playwright Core Apache-2.0; Chromium/BSD and third-party licenses, https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/LICENSE. No browser binary is distributed. Any separately installed browser retains its own LICENSE and credits.

Semantic icons: Lucide ISC and Simple Icons CC0; attribution and upstream brands retain their trademarks. Three.js MIT, d3 ISC, React MIT, React Router MIT, Lucide ISC, Radix MIT, Vite MIT, Tailwind MIT, TypeScript Apache-2.0. Exact installed dependency versions and all top-level license/NOTICE files follow and are preserved under licenses/npm.

Electron: MIT, copyright Electron contributors, https://github.com/electron/electron. Electron includes Chromium, Node.js and third-party components; the local App retains Electron's LICENSE and LICENSES.chromium.html. electron-builder: MIT, copyright electron-builder contributors, https://github.com/electron-userland/electron-builder. Full installed package licenses are included in licenses/npm.

OpenScreen: MIT, Siddharth Vaddem and contributors. Complete upstream notices: vendor/openscreen/LICENSE and vendor/openscreen/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. OpenTake modifications are AGPL-3.0.

Default cursor PNG artwork and normalized hotspots are synchronized from the locally installed official OpenScreen 2.1.2 distribution (MIT), copyright 2025 Siddharth Vaddem and 2025–2026 OpenScreen contributors. The browser zoom transition adapter follows that version's compositor behavior. Full license: vendor/openscreen/LICENSE. No OpenScreen executable is included.
